  none; Baidu will re-crawl on its own schedule anyway).

  Only canonical URLs are listed. The alias forms are deliberately excluded
  because they render byte-identical content and should consolidate:
    /browse                     -> /
    /browse/characters          -> /
    /browse/characters/popular  -> /
    /browse/<tab>               -> /browse/<tab>/popular   (or /total_rank for users)

  "/browse/*/recommended" is also excluded: it is personalized, so there is no
  single indexable version of it.
-->
